# This repo has one .env per deployable service (each never committed, only the .example files
# are). Copy each and fill in real values:
#
#   backend/.env.example  -> backend/.env         FastAPI admin API + in-process ingestion/AI/
#                                                  publishing worker (Supabase, Groq, etc.)
#   frontend/.env.example -> frontend/.env.local   Next.js public site + admin dashboard
#
# See backend/supabase/README.md for one-time Supabase project setup (schema, seed data, storage
# bucket, first admin user), and each service's own README.md for how to run/deploy it.
